<title>USA: GRC Intl arranges up to $22 mln in financing.</title>
<headline>GRC Intl arranges up to $22 mln in financing.</headline>
<dateline>VIENNA, Va. 1997-01-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>GRC International Inc said Thursday it arranged up to $22 million in financing over time and has cut its operating costs by about $1 million per month.</p>
<p>The company said in a release that the financing arrangement should provide funding for future growth of its telecommunications businesses and further strengthen its &quot;already profitable&quot; professional services operation.</p>
<p>The company said it &quot;believes this financing and re-deployment of resources will better enable it to achieve its full potential.&quot;</p>
</text>
